<title>RUSSIA: Russian 707-day OFZ bond tranche priced avg 98.86.</title>
<headline>Russian 707-day OFZ bond tranche priced avg 98.86.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of an additional 707-day tranche of Russian OFZ interest-bearing government bonds (series 24011) was an average 98.86 percent at an auction on Wednesday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>The earlier tranche closed at 98.85 to yield 39.68 percent on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Dealers had forecast the average price in a range of 98.56-99.87 percent.</p>
</text>
